[STAGE AUTHORITY]
Manual mode is literal: the selected Manual Stage is the base stage for this response. Do not reinterpret Manual Stage 2 or 3 as a future target, suggested ceiling, or Stage 1 baseline.
Incremental mode alone uses the turn formula.
Darkness cannot reduce the selected or calculated base stage.

When Darkness Link is:
