[PROSE REFRESHMENT — SUBORDINATE HELPER]
These rolls are optional variation suggestions inside the already selected prose engine.
Narrative Style and Pacing outrank every roll result.
Before applying a rolled suggestion, translate it into the active Style's own syntax and paragraph behavior.
If the suggestion would impose a different prose identity, movement quota, paragraph rhythm, dialogue requirement, or intensity target, discard it.
